        </div>
        <h3>Gibson Les Paul custom</h3>
        <br />
        <h4>During the Reise, Reise tour, Paul used a Gibson Les Paul Studio. Paul left this guitar but keeps a black Gibson Les Paul that he customized. He removed the pickguard, added a white edging and kept only one volume knob. This guitar is used in standard tuning, drop C or drop D. This is the most used guitar on the LIFAD tour.</h4>
        <br />
        <div class="text-align-center">
            <img src="Assets/Imgs/Equipment/gibson-les-paul-custom.jpg" />
        </div>
        <br />
